      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GELSOMINO AMAL (8) recorded another strong performance last start when she battled on bravely to go under by 1.8m at this venue, giving her a win and two seconds from her last three outings. Must overcome a very wide draw but she is going well. ISEEUBABY (9) draws wide but she is a capable mare who came from a similar barrier for a minor placing here two back. The driver has some work to do from this starting position but with even luck she could prove tough to beat. PRINCESS DIAMOND (12) is another that may be relying on luck given her second line draw but the form is hard to knock, winning four on the trot before leading from a wide barrier and sticking on for second last time out. RECOVER LOVER (1) hasn't been too far away when off the back row of late and should not have any excuses from the ace draw.",
